SCOPE

This licence covers the code in this repository: the design tokens, the
stylesheets, the HTML templates, the tooling and the documentation.

It does NOT cover:

  * The Future Forward and weXelerate logos and wordmarks
    (assets/logo/)
  * The event photography
    (assets/photos/)

Those are the property of weXelerate GmbH and may be used only for official
Future Forward and weXelerate communications. If you are reusing this system
for another project, replace them.

The four typefaces referenced by css/fonts.css — Sora, Barlow, JetBrains Mono
and Noto Serif Display — are each licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
by their respective authors and are not covered by this licence.
